OL,3,GNEWSASinking church faces closure if it
OL,4,Acan't raise #2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 170-year-old Anglican church which is
OL,7,Fsinking into the ground could be
OL,8,Fpermanently closed unless up to #2m is
OL,9,Fraised to repair it.
OL,11,FSt Mary Magdalene Parish Church in
OL,12,FOutwood, which is built on the site of
OL,13,Fan old pit, is at risk of collapse,
OL,14,Fmainly because of the issues affecting
OL,15,Fits foundations.
OL,17,FA footpath through the churchyard from
OL,18,FChurch Lane to Leeds Road has already
OL,19,Fbeen closed to the public as a
OL,20,Fprecaution.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
