OL,3,GNEWSASinking church faces closure if it
OL,4,Acan't raise #2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reverend Diane Komorowski said that
OL,7,Falthough the building may shut if the
OL,8,Fmoney is not found, the church
OL,9,Fcommunity would not close and worship
OL,10,Fwould take place elsewhere.
